{
  "key": 5126,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LookAtYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Well, well, look who’s here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PokemonSeemsRatherHappy",
      "en_US": [
        "This Pokémon seems to be rather\n",
        "happy.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PokemonEvolvedAlready",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve made your Pokémon evolve\n",
        "already?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_EntrustingWasNoMistake",
      "en_US": [
        "Entrusting you with that {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\n",
        "was no mistake, it seems!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GiveItANickname",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Well, would you like to give\n",
        "it a nickname?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_YoureHappyWithNickname",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: Hmm, OK, I see...\n",
        "And you’re happy with that nickname?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_CherishThatStarter",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: I’ll ask you to cherish that\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} of yours.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_DawnImGladYourKind",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I’m so glad that you’re kind\n",
        "toward Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LucasImGladYourKind",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Boy, am I glad you’re kind\n",
        "toward Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_SomethingIWantYouToDo",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor: There is something I want\n",
        "you to do for me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_RecordDataOnAllPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "I want to entrust you with this\n",
        "Pokédex.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LetMeAskYouAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Will you use it to record data on all\n",
        "the Pokémon in Sinnoh for me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GoodAnswer",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hm!\r",
        "Good answer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PlayerObtainedThePokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtained\n",
        "the {COLOR 1}Pokédex{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_MeetEveryKindOfPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: That Pokédex is a very\n",
        "high-tech device.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_DawnIveGotOneToo",
      "en_US": "Dawn: I’ve got one, too!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LucasIveGotTheSamePokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: I’ve got the same kind of\n",
        "Pokédex as you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GrandAdventureBeginsNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Now go!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your grand adventure\n",
        "begins right now!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GrandAdventureAwaitsYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Go on!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your grand adventure\n",
        "awaits you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_DawnHappyToTeachYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I’ll be happy to teach you things.\n",
        "Glad to meet you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LucasIllTeachYouStuff",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: I’ll teach you stuff later, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ImCounterpartsFather",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s father.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_HonorToBeAnAssistant",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Rowan invented a new\n",
        "Pokédex while working alongside a\f",
        "professor from the Kanto region.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_AdventureRuleNo1",
      "en_US": [
        "Adventure Rule No. 1\n",
        "The X Button opens the menu."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_AdventureRuleNo2",
      "en_US": [
        "Adventure Rule No. 2\n",
        "Record your progress with SAVE."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_CrammedFullOfBooks",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s crammed full of books with all\n",
        "sorts of Pokémon information."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ReferenceMaterial",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a lot of reference material\n",
        "and research reports on Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_YouveComeToShowProgress",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "You’ve come to show me your\n",
        "progress on the Pokédex?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_SoYouveSeenXPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\r",
        "So, you’ve seen {STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0} Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_WhatsWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s wrong?\r",
        "You’re not going to tell me you’ve\n",
        "seen too few to bother showing me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ExcellentWork",
      "en_US": [
        "Excellent work, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_MetEverySinnohPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hm! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I’ve been\n",
        "waiting to see you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GreetingsProfessorRowan",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Greetings, Professor Rowan!\n",
        "It’s been a very long time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_OldColleagueProfessorOak",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Oh! If it isn’t my old\n",
        "colleague, Professor Oak!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_IntroduceYouToMyAssistant",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak, let me introduce you\n",
        "to my young assistant.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LetMeUpgradeYourPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, well, very glad to meet you!\n",
        "As you’ve heard, my name is Oak.\r",
        "I see that you live up to--no--that\n",
        "you’ve surpassed his praise.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PokedexUpgradedWithNationalMode",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokédex was upgraded\n",
        "with the National Mode!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_WontBeEasyToComplete",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: I’m afraid it won’t be easy to\n",
        "complete the National Pokédex.\r",
        "However, I’m sure you will make an\n",
        "honest attempt on our behalf!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PlayerWillGetTheJobDone",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Have no fear, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "will get the job done.\r",
        "By the way, Professor Oak, what\n",
        "compelled you to visit this region?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PalParkIsNowOpen",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, yes. I’ve heard that the\n",
        "Pal Park is now open.\r",
        "If I remember correctly, it’s at the\n",
        "end of Route 221.\r",
        "The Pal Park has a special system\n",
        "that attracts every imaginable kind\f",
        "of Pokémon from every region.\r",
        "I’ve come to make certain that\n",
        "system is operating properly.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_VisitThePalParkMale",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you should make an\n",
        "effort to visit the Pal Park, too.\r",
        "Oops! I’ll be late for my meeting if\n",
        "I don’t get going!\r",
        "OK, it was a pleasure seeing the both\n",
        "of you! Bye, now!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_VisitThePalParkFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you should make an\n",
        "effort to visit the Pal Park, too.\r",
        "Oops! I’ll be late for my meeting if\n",
        "I don’t get going!\r",
        "OK, it was a pleasure seeing the both\n",
        "of you! Bye, now!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_OffHeGoes",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Off he goes, as busy as\n",
        "ever...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GiftForCompletingSinnohPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "I have a gift here as your reward\n",
        "for completing the Sinnoh Pokédex.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ThatsThePokemonRadar",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: That’s the Pokémon Radar,\n",
        "or just Poké Radar for short.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ManyMorePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: The world is immense.\n",
        "There are many more Pokémon.\r",
        "That means there are many more\n",
        "thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_PlayerCheckedThePC",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} checked the PC.\r",
        "The screen is filled with special terms\n",
        "and academic writing that is impossible\f",
        "to figure out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ResearchMaterialsTuckedAway",
      "en_US": [
        "Research materials are carefully\n",
        "tucked away."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_FilledWithTastySweets",
      "en_US": [
        "The refrigerator is filled with\n",
        "tasty sweets! Mmm..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_YouveBeenGreatForResearch",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s really quite something!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_StudyingPokedexSystems",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, that’s correct.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_YouReallyHaveDoneIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\n",
        "You’ve come back!\r",
        "Never has my heart pounded this hard\n",
        "for so long in my 60 years of living!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_DawnGladToSeeYouSafe",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, I’m glad to see you safe!\n",
        "Welcome back!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_LucasGladToSeeYouSafe",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: I’m glad to see you back safe, too.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_ObtainSunyshoresBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Why not obtain Sunyshore’s Badge?\r",
        "And why not challenge the Pokémon\n",
        "League?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GiveCynthiaMyBestRegards",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Oh, yes, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "If you see Cynthia, please give her \n",
        "my best regards."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_Dummy56",
      "garbage": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_Dummy57",
      "garbage": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_Dummy58",
      "garbage": 57
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_StunnedByGreatness",
      "en_US": [
        "I... I’m stunned by your greatness!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SandgemTownLab_Text_GaveMeShivers",
      "en_US": [
        "Hearing what was happening from the\n",
        "professor gave me shivers.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
